{
  "slug": "lightrun",
  "name": "Lightrun",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Lightrun's runtime investigation toolkit for Claude Code. Guides deterministic, evidence-first debugging of live applications by capturing real production behavior — variable state, stack traces, and execution flow — without redeploys or service restarts. Includes a mandatory preflight check that grounds investigations in actual runtime evidence, plus a blocker-aware handoff format that produces structured, reproducible debugging reports for engineering teams.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `lightrun-ask-prod` (Answer questions about live production system behavior — current variable values, execution durations, hit counts, and value distributions…), `lightrun-error-remediation-automation` (Guide deterministic runtime investigations in environments using Lightrun MCP tools, with preflight gating, recovery/resume rules, evidence-first diagnosis, PR-first…), `lightrun-live-runtime-debugging` (Diagnose live bugs and incidents that require runtime evidence from a running service using Lightrun MCP), `lightrun-runtime-aware-pr-review` (Use when reviewing a pull request with runtime or production evidence — for example to review a PR…)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install lightrun@claude-community` from `lightrun-platform/lightrun-ai`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
